{
  "name": "Social Publishing - Queue Processor (Cron)",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            {
              "field": "minutes",
              "minutesInterval": 15
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "cron-trigger",
      "name": "Schedule - Every 15 minutes",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [250, 300]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "getAll",
        "tableId": "social_queue",
        "returnAll": true,
        "filters": {
          "conditions": [
            {
              "keyName": "status",
              "keyValue": "pending"
            },
            {
              "keyName": "scheduled_for",
              "keyValue": "={{ $now.toISO() }}",
              "operator": "lte"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "supabase-query",
      "name": "Supabase - Récupérer items pending",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.supabase",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [450, 300],
      "credentials": {
        "supabaseApi": {
          "id": "supabase-credentials",
          "name": "Supabase API"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": ""
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.length }}",
              "rightValue": "0",
              "operator": {
                "type": "number",
                "operation": "gt"
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "if-has-items",
      "name": "IF - Has items?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [650, 300]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "batchSize": 1,
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "loop-items",
      "name": "Loop - Pour chaque item",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.splitInBatches",
      "typeVersion": 3,
      "position": [850, 300]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "// Mark as processing first\nconst item = $input.item.json;\n\nreturn {\n  json: {\n    id: item.id,\n    article_id: item.article_id,\n    article_title: item.article_title,\n    article_url: item.article_url,\n    article_excerpt: item.article_excerpt,\n    article_image_url: item.article_image_url,\n    article_category: item.article_category,\n    article_tags: item.article_tags,\n    platforms: item.platforms,\n    custom_message: item.custom_message,\n    user_id: item.user_id\n  }\n};"
      },
      "id": "prepare-item",
      "name": "Code - Préparer item",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [1050, 300]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "update",
        "tableId": "social_queue",
        "filterType": "manual",
        "filterValues": {
          "id": "={{ $json.id }}"
        },
        "dataMode": "defineBelow",
        "fieldsUi": {
          "fieldValues": [
            {
              "fieldName": "status",
              "fieldValue": "processing"
            },
            {
              "fieldName": "updated_at",
              "fieldValue": "={{ $now.toISO() }}"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "mark-processing",
      "name": "Supabase - Marquer processing",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.supabase",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [1250, 300],
      "credentials": {
        "supabaseApi": {
          "id": "supabase-credentials",
          "name": "Supabase API"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "// Create message for publication\nconst item = $input.item.json;\nconst customMessage = item.custom_message;\n\nconst message = customMessage || `${item.article_title}\\n\\n${item.article_excerpt}\\n\\nLire la suite : ${item.article_url}\\n\\n#${item.article_category || ''} ${item.article_tags ? item.article_tags.map(t => '#' + t).join(' ') : ''}`;\n\n// Return array of items, one per platform\nreturn item.platforms.map(platform => ({\n  json: {\n    queue_id: item.id,\n    article_id: item.article_id,\n    platform,\n    message,\n    article_url: item.article_url,\n    imageUrl: item.article_image_url\n  }\n}));"
      },
      "id": "prepare-publications",
      "name": "Code - Préparer publications",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [1450, 300]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "rules": {
          "values": [
            {
              "conditions": {
                "options": {
                  "caseSensitive": true
                },
                "conditions": [
                  {
                    "leftValue": "={{ $json.platform }}",
                    "rightValue": "facebook",
                    "operator": {
                      "type": "string",
                      "operation": "equals"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              "renameOutput": true,
              "outputKey": "facebook"
            },
            {
              "conditions": {
                "options": {
                  "caseSensitive": true
                },
                "conditions": [
                  {
                    "leftValue": "={{ $json.platform }}",
                    "rightValue": "linkedin",
                    "operator": {
                      "type": "string",
                      "operation": "equals"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              "renameOutput": true,
              "outputKey": "linkedin"
            },
            {
              "conditions": {
                "options": {
                  "caseSensitive": true
                },
                "conditions": [
                  {
                    "leftValue": "={{ $json.platform }}",
                    "rightValue": "instagram",
                    "operator": {
                      "type": "string",
                      "operation": "equals"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              "renameOutput": true,
              "outputKey": "instagram"
            },
            {
              "conditions": {
                "options": {
                  "caseSensitive": true
                },
                "conditions": [
                  {
                    "leftValue": "={{ $json.platform }}",
                    "rightValue": "tiktok",
                    "operator": {
                      "type": "string",
                      "operation": "equals"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              "renameOutput": true,
              "outputKey": "tiktok"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "platform-router",
      "name": "Switch - Router par plateforme",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.switch",
      "typeVersion": 3,
      "position": [1650, 300]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "url": "=https://graph.facebook.com/v18.0/{{ $env.FACEBOOK_PAGE_ID }}/feed",
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpHeaderAuth",
        "sendBody": true,
        "bodyParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "message",
              "value": "={{ $json.message }}"
            },
            {
              "name": "link",
              "value": "={{ $json.article_url }}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "publish-facebook",
      "name": "Facebook - Publier",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.1,
      "position": [1850, 200],
      "credentials": {
        "httpHeaderAuth": {
          "id": "facebook-auth",
          "name": "Facebook Header Auth"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "url": "https://api.linkedin.com/v2/ugcPosts",
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpHeaderAuth",
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ {\n  \"author\": \"urn:li:organization:\" + $env.LINKEDIN_ORGANIZATION_ID,\n  \"lifecycleState\": \"PUBLISHED\",\n  \"specificContent\": {\n    \"com.linkedin.ugc.ShareContent\": {\n      \"shareCommentary\": {\n        \"text\": $json.message\n      },\n      \"shareMediaCategory\": \"ARTICLE\",\n      \"media\": [\n        {\n          \"status\": \"READY\",\n          \"originalUrl\": $json.article_url\n        }\n      ]\n    }\n  },\n  \"visibility\": {\n    \"com.linkedin.ugc.MemberNetworkVisibility\": \"PUBLIC\"\n  }\n} }}",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "publish-linkedin",
      "name": "LinkedIn - Publier",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.1,
      "position": [1850, 300],
      "credentials": {
        "httpHeaderAuth": {
          "id": "linkedin-auth",
          "name": "LinkedIn Header Auth"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "// Aggregate results from all platforms\nconst items = $input.all();\nconst queueId = items[0].json.queue_id;\nconst articleId = items[0].json.article_id;\n\n// Check if any publication failed\nconst hasError = items.some(item => item.json.error);\n\nreturn {\n  json: {\n    queue_id: queueId,\n    article_id: articleId,\n    status: hasError ? 'failed' : 'completed',\n    error_message: hasError ? 'One or more publications failed' : null,\n    published_at: new Date().toISOString()\n  }\n};"
      },
      "id": "aggregate-results",
      "name": "Code - Agréger résultats",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [2050, 300]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "update",
        "tableId": "social_queue",
        "filterType": "manual",
        "filterValues": {
          "id": "={{ $json.queue_id }}"
        },
        "dataMode": "defineBelow",
        "fieldsUi": {
          "fieldValues": [
            {
              "fieldName": "status",
              "fieldValue": "={{ $json.status }}"
            },
            {
              "fieldName": "published_at",
              "fieldValue": "={{ $json.published_at }}"
            },
            {
              "fieldName": "error_message",
              "fieldValue": "={{ $json.error_message }}"
            },
            {
              "fieldName": "updated_at",
              "fieldValue": "={{ $now.toISO() }}"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "mark-completed",
      "name": "Supabase - Marquer completed",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.supabase",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [2250, 300],
      "credentials": {
        "supabaseApi": {
          "id": "supabase-credentials",
          "name": "Supabase API"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "update",
        "tableId": "articles",
        "filterType": "manual",
        "filterValues": {
          "id": "={{ $json.article_id }}"
        },
        "dataMode": "defineBelow",
        "fieldsUi": {
          "fieldValues": [
            {
              "fieldName": "published_on_facebook",
              "fieldValue": "={{ $json.published_at }}"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "update-article-facebook",
      "name": "Update Article - Facebook",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.supabase",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [2050, 200],
      "credentials": {
        "supabaseApi": {
          "id": "supabase-credentials",
          "name": "Supabase API"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "update",
        "tableId": "articles",
        "filterType": "manual",
        "filterValues": {
          "id": "={{ $json.article_id }}"
        },
        "dataMode": "defineBelow",
        "fieldsUi": {
          "fieldValues": [
            {
              "fieldName": "published_on_linkedin",
              "fieldValue": "={{ $now.toISO() }}"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "update-article-linkedin",
      "name": "Update Article - LinkedIn",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.supabase",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [2050, 350],
      "credentials": {
        "supabaseApi": {
          "id": "supabase-credentials",
          "name": "Supabase API"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Instructions:\n\n1. **Activer le workflow** après configuration\n\n2. **Credentials requis:**\n   - Supabase API\n   - Facebook Header Auth\n   - LinkedIn Header Auth\n\n3. **Fréquence:**\n   Cron s'exécute toutes les 15 minutes\n   → Ajustez si besoin dans Schedule node\n\n4. **Test:**\n   Ajoutez un article à la queue depuis l'UI\n   Vérifiez la table social_queue dans Supabase\n   Attendez que le cron s'exécute"
      },
      "id": "sticky-note",
      "name": "Note - Configuration",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [250, 100]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {},
      "id": "no-op",
      "name": "NoOp - Aucun item",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.noOp",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [850, 500]
    }
  ],
